    "title": "Iranian Security Official Calls for Regional Cooperation Against Israel",
    "text": "• Ali Larijani, head of Iran’s Supreme National Security Council, made a statement in Beirut on Saturday.\n• Larijani urged regional countries to set aside their differences and collaborate closely.\n• He described the need for cooperation as a response to what he termed 'Israel’s conspiracies.'\n• Larijani was in Beirut to attend the anniversary of the assassination of Hezbollah leader Hassan Nasrallah.",
